flowchart TB
    subgraph processingStates [Processing state]
        Received[Received] --> Processing[Processing]
        Processing -->|Material uncertainty| ReviewRequired[Review required]
        ReviewRequired -->|Correction or reprocess| Processing
        Processing -->|Quality gate passes| Accepted[Accepted]
        Processing -->|Deterministic or exhausted failure| Failed[Failed]
        ReviewRequired -->|Rejected by owner| Failed
    end

    subgraph publicationStates [Publication eligibility]
        NotEligible[Not eligible] -->|Approved but not yet effective| FutureEffective[Future effective]
        NotEligible -->|Approved and effective| Current[Current]
        FutureEffective -->|Effective date reached| Current
        Current -->|New revision atomically promoted| Superseded[Superseded]
        Current -->|End date reached| Expired[Expired]
        Current -->|Owner or source withdraws| Withdrawn[Withdrawn]
        FutureEffective -->|Owner or source withdraws| Withdrawn
        Superseded -->|Retention or legal-hold process| Deleted[Deleted from active stores]
        Expired -->|Retention or legal-hold process| Deleted
        Withdrawn -->|Retention or legal-hold process| Deleted
    end

    Accepted -->|Enter publication evaluation| NotEligible
    Failed -.-> Blocked[Failed revisions never enter publication]
    ReplacementFailure[Replacement failure does not change the previous valid Current revision]
    ReplacementFailure -.-> Failed
    ReplacementFailure -.-> Current
